## Reconnaissance

- What does the application do? 
    - Still the same basic shop website, but this time it has a 'check stock'-feature for the products
- Where is user input accepted? (forms, URL parameters, headers, cookies)
    - there is no input field (account login is back) but after sending the request to burp repeater it is possible to change the storeId and get a http 400 response, meaning the server has no idea what to do with the request
- What happens with normal input?
    - inputting a normal id works as usual and gives back how many units are in stock

